{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cf59","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07a40-291a-7b50-9359-ce2838523baf"},"sequence":1543,"recorded_at":1780531400003081,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5c56535d-a447-4a6e-a8da-9b382d4b9205","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"5c56535d-a447-4a6e-a8da-9b382d4b9205","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5c56535d-a447-4a6e-a8da-9b382d4b9205"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"92a9572a-8995-4a96-bc18-2a12d5ab2ca0"},"task_id":"92a9572a-8995-4a96-bc18-2a12d5ab2ca0","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"92a9572a-8995-4a96-bc18-2a12d5ab2ca0","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-56-1\",\n  \"command\": \"python3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\nitems=json.load(open('/tmp/attach_mutants.json'))\\nfor m in items:\\n    if m['id'] in ('S-tb-shadow','N-tb-parseid-uppercase','C-tb-parseid-dead-arm'):\\n        print('='*30); print('ID:',m['id']); print('CLASS:',m['class']); print('EXPECT:',m.get('expect'))\\n        print('CENSUS_RUN:',m.get('census_run')); print('BEHAV_RUN:',m.get('behav_run')); print('AUDIT_RUN:',repr(m.get('audit_run')), 'AUDIT_PKG:',repr(m.get('audit_pkg')))\\n        print('OLD:'); print(m['old']); print('NEW:'); print(m['new'])\\n\\\"\",\n  \"description\": \"Show shadow and narrowing mutant bodies\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"==============================\\nID: N-tb-parseid-uppercase\\nCLASS: narrowing\\nEXPECT: behav KILLED (uppercase IDs admitted: widened grammar + echo + reserved tests); census SURVIVED (no site changed)\\nCENSUS_RUN: TestDerivedRefusalArmsAreAllDeclared|TestDeclaredRefusalArmsAreAllDerived|TestDeclaredRefusalWiresMatchProductionConsts|TestDefensiveBoundsAreExactlyThese|TestDigitCensusCoversEveryLeafGuard|TestDigitGuardDigitRuneAdmitsCodePointSpellings|TestDerivedSiteLinesAreExactlyRowed|TestRefusalSiteAttributionIsExact|TestRefuseFunnelRejectsAliases|TestShadowedLookupsHaveNoInput|TestCheckTransitionOperationVocabularyIsUnreachable|TestDecodeCappedValueDefensiveSitesAreUnreachable|TestCanonicalPlumbingIsTotalOnDecodedMaps|TestPlainErrorsLiveOnlyInTheirTwoFunctions|TestPlatformFunnelDetailsAreExactlyThese\\nBEHAV_RUN: TestParseIDAdmitsCanonicalIdentities|TestParseIDRefusesWidenedGrammar|TestParseIDRefusesReservedNamespace|TestParseIDGrammarRefusalEchoesNothing|TestEveryDeclaredArmRefusesAtItsEntry|TestDigestFile|TestDigestFileRefusalsAreNeverWireErrors|TestCheckProviderDescriptor|TestLegacyReverseProjectionExistsOnlyForThePair\\nAUDIT_RUN: None AUDIT_PKG: None\\nOLD:\\nidPattern = regexp.MustCompile(`^[a-z][a-z0-9]*(?:[.-][a-z0-9]+)*$`)\\nNEW:\\nidPattern = regexp.MustCompile(`^[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*(?:[.-][a-zA-Z0-9]+)*$`)\\n==============================\\nID: C-tb-parseid-dead-arm\\nCLASS: census-only\\nEXPECT: census KILLED (new arm, no declared row); behav SURVIVED (unreachable: space fails the grammar first)\\nCENSUS_RUN: TestDerivedRefusalArmsAreAllDeclared|TestDeclaredRefusalArmsAreAllDerived|TestDeclaredRefusalWiresMatchProductionConsts|TestDefensiveBoundsAreExactlyThese|TestDigitCensusCoversEveryLeafGuard|TestDigitGuardDigitRuneAdmitsCodePointSpellings|TestDerivedSiteLinesAreExactlyRowed|TestRefusalSiteAttributionIsExact|TestRefuseFunnelRejectsAliases|TestShadowedLookupsHaveNoInput|TestCheckTransitionOperationVocabularyIsUnreachable|TestDecodeCappedValueDefensiveSitesAreUnreachable|TestCanonicalPlumbingIsTotalOnDecodedMaps|TestPlainErrorsLiveOnlyInTheirTwoFunctions|TestPlatformFunnelDetailsAreExactlyThese\\nBEHAV_RUN: TestParseIDAdmitsCanonicalIdentities|TestParseIDRefusesWidenedGrammar|TestParseIDRefusesReservedNamespace|TestParseIDGrammarRefusalEchoesNothing|TestEveryDeclaredArmRefusesAtItsEntry|TestDigestFile|TestDigestFileRefusalsAreNeverWireErrors|TestCheckProviderDescriptor|TestLegacyReverseProjectionExistsOnlyForThePair\\nAUDIT_RUN: None AUDIT_PKG: None\\nOLD:\\n\\tif strings.HasPrefix(value, reservedNamespace) && value != BuiltinTmux && value != BuiltinConpty {\\nNEW:\\n\\tif value == \\\"never.reached shadow\\\" {\\n\\t\\treturn \\\"\\\", refuse(&Error{Code: CodeNotFound, Detail: \\\"terminal_backend_id shadow\\\"})\\n\\t}\\n\\tif strings.HasPrefix(value, reservedNamespace) && value != BuiltinTmux && value != BuiltinConpty {\\n==============================\\nID: S-tb-shadow\\nCLASS: audit-only\\nEXPECT: census SURVIVES (derived set byte-identical) and behav SURVIVES (sibling refuses with the same pair); ONLY the audit kills, naming the dead site (leaf3 design, re-verified on this tree)\\nCENSUS_RUN: TestDerivedRefusalArmsAreAllDeclared|TestDeclaredRefusalArmsAreAllDerived|TestDeclaredRefusalWiresMatchProductionConsts|TestDefensiveBoundsAreExactlyThese|TestDigitCensusCoversEveryLeafGuard|TestDigitGuardDigitRuneAdmitsCodePointSpellings|TestDerivedSiteLinesAreExactlyRowed|TestRefusalSiteAttributionIsExact|TestRefuseFunnelRejectsAliases|TestShadowedLookupsHaveNoInput|TestCheckTransitionOperationVocabularyIsUnreachable|TestDecodeCappedValueDefensiveSitesAreUnreachable|TestCanonicalPlumbingIsTotalOnDecodedMaps|TestPlainErrorsLiveOnlyInTheirTwoFunctions|TestPlatformFunnelDetailsAreExactlyThese\\nBEHAV_RUN: TestParseIDAdmitsCanonicalIdentities|TestParseIDRefusesWidenedGrammar|TestParseIDRefusesReservedNamespace|TestParseIDGrammarRefusalEchoesNothing|TestEveryDeclaredArmRefusesAtItsEntry|TestDigestFile|TestDigestFileRefusalsAreNeverWireErrors|TestCheckProviderDescriptor|TestLegacyReverseProjectionExistsOnlyForThePair\\nAUDIT_RUN: '' AUDIT_PKG: './internal/terminalbackend/'\\nOLD:\\n\\tsession, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(sessionID)\\n\\tif err != nil {\\n\\t\\treturn refuse(&Error{Code: CodePreconditionFailed, Detail: \\\"entrypoint session binding\\\"})\\n\\t}\\nNEW:\\n\\tsession, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(sessionID)\\n\\tif err != nil || sessionID != argv[2] {\\n\\t\\treturn refuse(&Error{Code: CodePreconditionFailed, Detail: \\\"entrypoint session binding\\\"})\\n\\t}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4418,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1105,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
